  "prefLabel": "Plc 212.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 212.02 Applicability. Unless otherwise specified, Plc 212 shall apply to the procurement of goods and services by the OPLC using a request for bid (RFB), request for application (RFA), request for proposal (RFP), or similar invitation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
